OL,4,CBody found in search for missing 20-   
OL,5,Cyear-old woman                         
OL,6,GA body has been found in the search    
OL,7,Gfor a missing 20-year-old woman in     
OL,8,GDumfries and Galloway.                 
OL,10,FFormal identification has not yet      
OL,11,Ftaken place but the family of Kelsey   
OL,12,FHunter has been informed. She was last 
OL,13,Fseen in Castle Douglas at 17:00 on     
OL,14,FSaturday and a major search has been   
OL,15,Ftaking place in her nearby home        
OL,16,Fvillage of Springholm.                 
OL,18,FDaniel McKnight, 21, appeared on       
OL,19,FTuesday on petition in Dumfries        
OL,20,FSheriff Court charged with murder and  
OL,21,Ftwo other charges, including defeating 
OL,22,Fthe ends of justice.                   
